- **Payment channel**: `<EFTPS | IRS Direct Pay | state portal | check | other>`
- **Account debited**: `<institution + last 4 only>`
- **Confirmation reference**: `<masked as needed>`
- **Prior-year overpayment applied**: `<$ | none | unverified>`

